{
  "library": "SWAM",
  "vendor": "Audio Modeling",
  "_doc": "Modeled instruments: CC11 is required (no sound without it), CC1 = vibrato depth, velocity on an overlapped note = portamento time (Portamento Control = Velocity), on an attacked note = attack hardness. expression.dynMap [offset, slope] maps the piece dynamic (0-127) to CC11. vibrato.depth is the CC1 peak at mf. Load one SWAM per command and check Transpose / Pitch Bend with fx_params (see AGENTS.md).",
